      "id": "feedback",
      "title": "A careful piece of feedback",
      "level": "advanced",
      "setting": "The end of a design review.",
      "lines": [
        {
          "speaker": "Leah",
          "text": "The structure is clear, and the opening does a lot of work. I wouldn't change that."
        },
        {
          "speaker": "Noah",
          "text": "That's a relief. I was uneasy about the middle section."
        },
        {
          "speaker": "Leah",
          "text": "That's the part I'd look at. It seems to repeat the same claim three times, albeit with different examples."
        },
        {
          "speaker": "Noah",
          "text": "So cut two of them?"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "Leah",
          "text": "I'd keep the strongest one and move the others to an appendix. Otherwise we risk undermining the pace."
        },
        {
          "speaker": "Noah",
          "text": "Noted. I'll send a shorter version by Thursday."
        },
        {
          "speaker": "Leah",
          "text": "Perfect. And for what it's worth, the last line is the one people will remember."
        }
      ],
